onflicts clearly\\n- \\u2713 Restore stashed changes after successful sync\\n- \\u2713 Complete operations within 30 seconds for typical repositories\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Use existing base classes and configuration system\\n- Implement using Test-Driven Development (TDD)\\n- Comprehensive error handling\\n- Logging of all synchronization events\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Full repository migration\\n- Complex merge conflict resolution\\n- Support for non-git version control systems\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Base git configuration and authentication are already set up\\n- Typical repository size is under 1GB\\n- Standard git workflow (single branch, linear history)"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RMw2xVxr3sCCvTPBAApYjk', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# GitHub Sync Bot - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project**: GitHub Sync Bot Implementation\n**Type**: Milestone 2 of 6 in GitHub Bots Suite\n**Scope**: Advanced git synchronization capabilities\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Core Infrastructure & Remote Operations\n**Duration**: 3-4 days\n**Objective**: Establish foundational sync capabilities\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Remote repository connection management\n- Basic fetch/pull operations\n- Configuration system integration\n- Core error handling framework\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✓ Can connect to multiple remote repositories\n- ✓ Fetch operations complete successfully\n- ✓ Pull operations work without conflicts\n- ✓ Basic error logging implemented\n\n**Dependencies**: Base classes and configuration system\n\n### Milestone 2: Branch Management & Stash Operations\n**Duration**: 4-5 days\n**Objective**: Implement safe branch operations with stash management\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Stash save/restore/list functionality\n- Branch rebase capabilities\n- Uncommitted changes preservation\n- Enhanced conflict detection\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✓ Safely stash uncommitted changes before sync\n- ✓ Restore stashed changes after successful sync\n- ✓ Rebase operations work with conflict detection\n- ✓ Clear error reporting for conflicts\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 completion\n\n### Milestone 3: Advanced Error Handling & Performance\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\n**Objective**: Robust error handling and performance optimization\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Comprehensive conflict resolution reporting\n- Performance optimization for large repos\n- Complete logging system\n- Final testing and documentation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✓ Operations complete within 30 seconds for typical repos\n- ✓ Detailed conflict detection and reporting\n- ✓ All synchronization events logged\n- ✓ Complete test coverage\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 completion\n\n## Success Metrics\n- All acceptance criteria met\n- Test coverage > 90%\n- Performance benchmarks achieved\n- Integration with existing bot suite\n- Documentation complete\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n- Use TDD to catch issues early\n- Incremental development approach\n- Regular integration testing\n- Clear rollback procedures for each milestone'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RMw2xVxr3sCCvTPBAApYjk', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224251.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224251.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GmqKxBxEaYWqSPAL9sPjDb', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'GitHub Sync Bot'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01GmqKxBxEaYWqSPAL9sPjDb', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UmRxa8gbsnpZUvdDUUXrUZ', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'project_name': 'GitHub Sync Bot'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UmRxa8gbsnpZUvdDUUXrUZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GfiUT7urbVKt6cGYTCAfi3', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01GfiUT7urbVKt6cGYTCAfi3', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# GitHub Sync Bot - Architecture Proposal\\n\\n## A. Architecture Overview\\n\\n### Purpose\\nA robust git synchronization bot designed to handle complex remote repository interactions with emphasis on safety, performance, and clear error reporting.\\n\\n### Architecture Pattern\\n- **Architectural Style**: Modular, Event-Driven Service\\n- **Core Design Pattern**: Command Pattern for git operations\\n- **Synchronization Model**: Asynchronous with comprehensive state management\\n\\n## B. Tech Stack\\n\\n### Languages and Frameworks\\n- **Primary Language**: Python 3.9+\\n- **Git Interaction**: GitPython library\\n- **Async Processing**: asyncio\\n- **Logging**: Structured logging with `loguru`\\n\\n### Rationale\\n- Python chosen for:\\n  - Strong typing\\n  - Excellent async support\\n  - Rich ecosystem for system automation\\n- GitPython provides low-level git operations with pythonic abstractions\\n- `asyncio` enables non-blocking synchronization processes\\n\\n## C. System Components\\n\\n1. **RepositorySyncManager**\\n   - Orchestrates entire synchronization workflow\\n   - Manages multiple repository interactions\\n   - Coordinates stash, rebase, and conflict detection\\n\\n2. **RemoteRepositoryHandler**\\n   - Handles remote repository connections\\n   - Manages fetch, pull operations\\n   - Supports multiple remote repository tracking\\n\\n3. **StashManager**\\n   - Safe stash creation and restoration\\n   - Tracks uncommitted changes\\n   - Provides rollback capabilities\\n\\n4. **ConflictResolver**\\n   - Detects synchronization conflicts\\n   - Generates detailed error reports\\n   - Preserves repository state during conflicts\\n\\n5. **EventLogger**\\n   - Comprehensive event logging\\n   - Structured log generation\\n   - Performance and error tracking\\n\\n## D. File/Directory Structure\\n```\\ngithub_sync_bot/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 src/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 core/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 repository_sync_manager.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 remote_repository_handler.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 stash_manager.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 conflict_resolver.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 utils/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 event_logger.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 configuration.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 main.py\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 tests/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 unit/\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 integration/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 logs/\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 config.yaml\\n```\\n\\n## E. Data Model & State Management\\n\\n### Configuration\\n```yaml\\ngithub_sync_bot:\\n  timeout: 30  # seconds\\n  log_level: INFO\\n  repositories:\\n    - name: primary_repo\\n      url: https://github.com/example/repo\\n      branch: main\\n```\\n\\n### State Tracking\\n- Immutable state snapshots\\n- Comprehensive error state preservation\\n- Minimal in-memory state to ensure performance\\n\\n## F. API Design\\n\\n### Sync Operation Interface\\n```python\\nasync def synchronize_repository(\\n    repo_path: str, \\n    remote: str = \'origin\', \\n    branch: str = \'main\'\\n) -> SyncResult:\\n    \\"\\"\\"\\n    Synchronize a repository with specified parameters\\n    \\n    Returns:\\n    - Success/Failure status\\n    - Detailed operation log\\n    - Conflict information if applicable\\n    \\"\\"\\"\\n```\\n\\n## G. Deployment Strategy\\n\\n### Runtime Environment\\n- Docker container for consistent deployment\\n- Kubernetes for scalable, managed execution\\n- CI/CD via GitHub Actions\\n\\n### Configuration Management\\n- Environment-based configuration\\n- Secrets management via secure vaults\\n\\n## H. Testing Strategy\\n\\n### Testing Approach\\n- 100% Unit Test Coverage\\n- Integration Tests for Complex Workflows\\n- Mutation Testing for Robustness\\n\\n### Test Categories\\n1. Successful Synchronization Scenarios\\n2. Conflict Detection\\n3. Stash Management\\n4. Error Handling Paths\\n\\n## I. Alternatives Considered\\n\\n### Alternative 1: Direct Git CLI Wrapper\\n- **Pros**: Lightweight, direct system interaction\\n- **Cons**: Less robust error handling, more complex scripting\\n\\n### Alternative 2: Full Git Server Implementation\\n- **Pros**: Complete control over synchronization\\n- **Cons**: Overengineered, significant complexity overhead\\n\\n## J. Risks and Mitigations\\n\\n1. **Repository Size Limitations**\\n   - Mitigation: Implement chunked processing\\n   - Soft limit: 1GB (per requirement)\\n\\n2. **Authentication Failures**\\n   - Mitigation: Comprehensive credential management\\n   - Fallback to manual intervention\\n\\n3. **Network Instability**\\n   - Mitigation: Exponential backoff, reconnection strategies\\n\\n## K. Open Questions\\n\\n1. Specific authentication mechanism for multiple repositories\\n2. Detailed conflict resolution strategy beyond current scope\\n3. Performance tuning for large repositories\\n\\n## Conclusion\\n\\nThis architecture provides a robust, performant solution for git repository synchronization, meeting all specified requirements while maintaining flexibility for future enhancements."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Ss4kc1Fjnx7BZUBayBuvCL', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Core Infrastructure & Remote Operations - Establish foundational sync capabilities with remote repository connection management, basic fetch/pull operations, configuration system integration, and core error handling framework', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Ss4kc1Fjnx7BZUBayBuvCL', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 15, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "dependencies": ["Remote Connection Management \\u2192 Git Configuration Integration", "Error Handling Framework \\u2192 Git Repository Service", "Git 