eTool is used\\n\\nThe fixes build on each other:\\n- WriteFileTool calls `record_file_generated()`\\n- `record_file_generated()` calls `increment_request_counts(files=1)`\\n- Timeline and file APIs then return correct data\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n\\n1. **Functional**: Run a test that creates files via WriteFileTool \\u2192 verify files appear in activity tracker\\n2. **Counts**: Request timeline shows accurate agent/file/commit counts\\n3. **Regression**: All existing tests pass\\n4. **Compatibility**: Tools work with or without tracking context\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Plan created by Development Manager*\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015cNUnShVedDLt886YQsxXD', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'update_task', 'project_id': 'b4f4dd2f', 'task_id': '0c2da100', 'status': 'in_progress', 'note': 'Starting Development Manager workflow for Activity Tracking Fixes - reading existing milestone plan'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015cNUnShVedDLt886YQsxXD', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Updated task status to in_progress"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012crb7PeoNZALd7ZaYjyMQS', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/milestone_plan.md', 'project_name': 'Activity Tracking Fixes', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012crb7PeoNZALd7ZaYjyMQS', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01AZx84rMddBejdTV2R3L4uV', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type':