are interconnected and should be delivered together.\\n\\n**Deliverables:**\\n1. Updated `src/runtime/agents/tools.py`:\\n   - Modify `WriteFileTool.__init__()` to accept tracking context parameters\\n   - Modify `WriteFileTool.execute()` to record file generation to ActivityTracker\\n   - Update `ToolRegistry.default()` to pass tracking context to WriteFileTool\\n\\n2. Updated `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py`:\\n   - Add auto-increment calls to `record_agent_started()`\\n   - Add auto-increment calls to `record_file_generated()`\\n   - Add auto-increment calls to `record_git_commit()`\\n\\n3. Test file(s) verifying:\\n   - WriteFileTool records to activity tracker when context is provided\\n   - WriteFileTool works without context (backward compatibility)\\n   - increment_request_counts updates counters correctly\\n   - Integration: file generation flows through to activity APIs\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\\n1. WriteFileTool accepts and uses agent_id, agent_name, request_id parameters\\n2. Files written by agents appear in `/api/activity/files` endpoint\\n3. Request timeline shows non-zero agent_count, file_count, commit_count\\n4. All existing tests continue to pass\\n5. Backward compatibility maintained - tools work without tracking context\\n\\n**Dependencies:** None - this is the foundation fix\\n\\n**Risk Assessment:**\\n- Low risk: Changes are localized to two files\\n- Circular import potential: Mitigated with local imports\\n- Performance: Minimal impact from tracking calls\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Implementation Strategy\\n\\nGiven that all three bugs are interconnected (files need to be tracked for counts to increment correctly), this is structured as a **single milestone** with coordinated changes:\\n\\n1. **Bug #1 (HIGH)**: WriteFileTool tracking - enables file generation recording\\n2. **Bug #2 (MEDIUM)**: Auto-increment calls - ensures counters update automatically\\n3. **Bug #3 (LOW)**: Addressed implicitly - file tracking works everywhere WriteFileTool is used\\n\\nThe fixes build on each other:\\n- WriteFileTool calls `record_file_generated()`\\n- `record_file_generated()` calls `increment_request_counts(files=1)`\\n- Timeline and file APIs then return correct data\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n\\n1. **Functional**: Run a test that creates files via WriteFileTool \\u2192 verify files appear in activity tracker\\n2. **Counts**: Request timeline shows accurate agent/file/commit counts\\n3. **Regression**: All existing tests pass\\n4. **Compatibility**: Tools work with or without tracking context\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Plan created by Development Manager*\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015cNUnShVedDLt886YQsxXD', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'update_task', 'project_id': 'b4f4dd2f', 'task_id': '0c2da100', 'status': 'in_progress', 'note': 'Starting Development Manager workflow for Activity Tracking Fixes - reading existing milestone plan'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015cNUnShVedDLt886YQsxXD', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Updated task status to in_progress"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012crb7PeoNZALd7ZaYjyMQS', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/milestone_plan.md', 'project_name': 'Activity Tracking Fixes', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012crb7PeoNZALd7ZaYjyMQS', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01AZx84rMddBejdTV2R3L4uV', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/milestone_plan.md', 'project_name': 'Activity Tracking Fixes', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/architecture.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01AZx84rMddBejdTV2R3L4uV', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "architecture_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/architecture.md", "message": "Developed a lightweight, optional tracking mechanism for agent activities with minimal system impact", "key_decisions": ["Implement optional tracking context in WriteFileTool", "Create non-intrusive activity tracking in ActivityTracker", "Maintain backward compatibility with existing tools"], "self_analysis": "The architecture proposal successfully addresses the core tracking issues by introducing a flexible, low-overhead mechanism for capturing agent activities. The design maintains system integrity while solving the visibility problem, with carefully considered trade-offs between tracking granularity and system complexity."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01X5taZmkWwwXdKFbCDPS2zF', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Core Bug Fixes - Fix all three identified activity tracking bugs to enable proper visibility into agent activity', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_e